#. module: helpdesk_stock
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:helpdesk_stock.field_stock_picking__ticket_visibility
msgid ""
"People to whom this helpdesk team and its tickets will be visible.\n"
"\n"
"- Invited internal users: internal users can access the team and the tickets "
"they are following. This access can be modified on each ticket individually "
"by adding or removing the user as follower.\n"
"A user with the helpdesk > administrator access right level can still access "
"this team and its tickets, even if they are not explicitely part of the "
"followers.\n"
"\n"
"- All internal users: all internal users can access the team and all of its "
"tickets without distinction.\n"
"\n"
"- Invited portal users and all internal users: all internal users can access "
"the team and all of its tickets without distinction.\n"
"Portal users can only access the tickets they are following. This access can "
"be modified on each ticket individually by adding or removing the portal "
"user as follower."
msgstr ""
"Osebe, ki jim bosta vidni ta ekipa službe za pomoč uporabnikom in njene "
"zahteve. \n"
"\n"
"- Povabljeni interni uporabniki: interni uporabniki lahko dostopajo do ekipe "
"in zahtevkov, ki jim sledijo. Ta dostop je mogoče spremeniti za vsak "
"zahtevek posebej z dodajanjem ali odstranjevanjem uporabnika kot sledilca.\n"
"Uporabnik s pravico dostopa služba za pomoč uporabnikom > skrbnik lahko še "
"vedno dostopa do te ekipe in njenih zahtevkov, tudi če ni izrecno del "
"sledilcev.\n"
"- Vsi interni uporabniki: vsi interni uporabniki lahko dostopajo do ekipe in "
"vseh njenih zahtevkov brez razlikovanja. \n"
"\n"
"- Povabljeni uporabniki portala in vsi interni uporabniki: vsi interni "
"uporabniki lahko dostopajo do ekipe in vseh njenih zahtevkov brez "
"razlikovanja.\n"
"Uporabniki portala lahko dostopajo samo do zahtevkov, ki jim sledijo. Ta "
"dostop je mogoče spremeniti za vsak zahtevek posebej z dodajanjem ali "
"odstranjevanjem uporabnika portala kot sledilca."

